      ],
      "source": "https://onlineutah.us/paradisehistory.shtml"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The first settlers arrived in Paradise during March of 1860.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://onlineutah.us/paradisehistory.shtml"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Men from Draper, Utah, founded Paradise after searching for a lush, green valley with plenty of water.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://onlineutah.us/paradisehistory.shtml"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Barnard White built a small log cabin in Paradise to establish residency using local timber.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27
